# Local environment template for USTC Campus Agent
#
# Copy to .env only for local development. Do not commit .env.
# Never store raw USTC passwords, CAS cookies, MFA material, GitHub tokens, or model keys in this file inside the repository.

# Optional local path for approved, scrubbed, read-only catalog snapshots.
# USTC_CATALOG_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/absolute/path/to/approved/snapshots

# Optional local path for generated acceptance evidence.
# USTC_AGENT_EVIDENCE_DIR=/absolute/path/to/evidence
